Z||000009||AusFiero||08-17-2001||04:45 AM||||Well personally my opinion on this nose is NOOOOOOOOO don't do it. But each to his own  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>Heres the scoops on it. Was hard to do on a small low res image.<P>The skyline tail light kit will be after the skirts are done. Side scoops have been giving me some drama. Twice I have shaped the bottem edge of the scoop, twice I have ground them out. Not happy with the shape. Got it right this time I think. 3rd time lucky. That or I am too bloody fussy.<P>Here's the umm shogun thingy.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/aussaysnooooo.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
